WEBVTT

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.930
NEW TEACHER
WITH AN OUTSTANDING FEATURE

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:21.890
BACK TO SCHOOL

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.230
-We're glad to have you, Mr. Iguchi.
-Thank you. Uh, what is it?

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.690
-Are you kidding me or what?
-No, not at all.

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:32.360
-That's fine, then. Good luck.
-Thank you. See you then.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:33.780
Is he all right?

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:37.030
<i>Yeah, he had a great reputation</i>
<i>at the previous school.</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.870
<i>He was known as a caring teacher</i>
<i>and a hard worker.</i>

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.960
<i>It's class 2-3.</i>
<i>I hope they will open up to me.</i>

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.250
-Just...
-<i>No, that's my job!</i>

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:48.130
-...his face...
-<i>I'll make my class fun!</i>

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.420
<i>Yes, he has a pervert look.</i>

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.880
<i>Did you see the new teacher?</i>

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.340
-He's gonna be our homeroom teacher!
-For real?

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.470
He looks like a criminal.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:55.430
<i>His face gets dissed a lot.</i>

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:59.140
<i>I'm not sure about his face,</i>
<i>but he seems nice.</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.810
-He looks guilty of sexual assaults.
-He sure does.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:02.720
<i>You, too.</i>

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:04.890
That's enough! You can't judge people
by appearances.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:05.810
Hairo!

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.110
You guys are just overreacting
and being so rude to him.

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.020
Kuboyasu!

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:13.820
-Right, we're rude to the pervert teacher.
-That pervert doesn't have to be that.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:14.740
<i>How rude.</i>

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:16.700
<i>That's already enough.</i>

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:18.410
<i>He should be here in no time.</i>

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:20.490
<i>Here it is. I'm so nervous.</i>

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:24.120
<i>Maybe I'm breathing hard</i>
<i>and my face is blushing.</i>

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.370
Here he is!

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.040
<i>I shouldn't let them notice</i>
<i>my nervousness.</i>

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:31.170
<i>I have to stay calm, walk in slowly...</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.340
<i>and smile!</i>

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.670
<i>-He is a pervert!</i>
<i>-He is.</i>

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.590
<i>What? They're so quiet.</i>

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.260
Is something wrong?

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.470
No! Stop it, animal!

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.390
"Animal"?

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.180
<i>It's an antonym for teacher.</i>

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:49.520
<i>Is she nervous? How can I make her relax?</i>
<i>I know.</i>

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:51.480
Don't be so nervous, Yumehara.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:52.940
How did you know my name?

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:55.110
Because you're my student.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.990
<i>I spent a week memorizing their names.</i>

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:00.240
<i>Now I know all 11th graders' names.</i>

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:03.040
<i>Did he research me?</i>

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.240
<i>That's not quite right.</i>

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:08.290
Not only your name, but your address, too.

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:09.210
<i>Better stop right there.</i>

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.210
No! I'm going to transfer schools!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:15.380
Don't lose your mind, Yumehara!
Mr. Iguchi, I need to talk with you!

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:17.590
I see. I get it now.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:21.680
I've often been told
that I appear suspicious or perverted.

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:24.470
I had totally forgotten about that.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:27.640
-I'm sorry! We judged you wrong.
-It's okay.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:32.610
But I trust you that you won't set up
a hidden camera in a girl's locker room!

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:34.610
Thank... What? Do you think I'd do that?

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:37.820
Wait a minute.
I know people often get me wrong,

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:41.160
but look at me carefully one more time.
Do I look like a liar?

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.120
<i>Was that his most sincere look?</i>

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:54.840
If you get to know me, you will never
see me as a perverted teacher.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:57.670
My name is Takumi Iguchi.
I'm 25 years old.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.300
<i>It doesn't help much.</i>

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:02.090
I've only been a teacher for three years.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.430
<i>Pervert...</i>

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:05.260
<i>Pervert.</i>

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:08.730
I hope we will become
more than just teacher and students.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:11.190
Mr. Iguchi, stop sexually harassing us!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.900
<i>I had no idea how words change meaning</i>
<i>depending on what someone looks like.</i>

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:16.530
Keep 300 feet away from Teruhashi-san!

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:18.740
I didn't say any... Three hundred?

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.320
<i>He can't even be in the classroom.</i>

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.240
Stay away from me!

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:22.740
-We're in the same class.
-<i>You guys are late.</i>

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.700
I don't want to be misunderstood.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.410
<i>Nendou-kun and Saiko-kun!</i>

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.450
-Who the hell are you?
-You have a funny face!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:29.370
<i>You too.</i>

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:33.790
Ms. Shima is in charge of class 2. I'll be
your homeroom teacher starting today.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.500
You guys are 20 minutes late.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.300
Sorry, sorry. I was chasing after a cat.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.760
Will you let me go this time?

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:42.970
-What a sight!
-He's just an idiot, but he scares him.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:43.970
He's getting nervous.

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.680
Five or ten minutes can be excused,
but 20 minutes is unacceptable.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.140
It can't be helped, then.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.600
-Okay, let's continue where we left off.
-It's my way of saying hi.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.570
Don't care about this poor dumb guy,
but you'd better obey me, poor face.

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:59.610
-I can let you go this time...
-<i>I knew it.</i>

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.450
...for attempting to buy me off.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.950
I won't treat you with favoritism.
You're late, too.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:06.120
Mr. Iguchi! I'm sorry!

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.870
You didn't even give in to Saiko!
You're the best teacher!

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.200
<i>They finally understand him.</i>

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.910
No problem at all!
I'm so glad you accept me.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.710
<i>Well, it may take more time after all.</i>

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.880
<i>Let's continue where I left off...</i>

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:25.890
THE DISASTER OF THE SCHOOL PHYSICAL

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.970
<i>When I faced off against the guy,</i>
<i>I instantly had a feeling</i>

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.850
<i>that he is the same sort of person</i>
<i>as I am!</i>

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:34.440
<i>No doubt about it.</i>

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.900
<i>-He is a natural born pervert, too!</i>
<i>-Wrong.</i>

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:40.230
As I told you the other day,
we're having physical exams today.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.780
The girls will have medical exams
in the nurse's office first.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.700
<i>Stop sharing exactly the same images.</i>

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.910
What a drag. Right, buddy?

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:49.910
<i>I do agree with Nendou on this matter.</i>

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.620
Okay, don't move. Saiki, 66 inches.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.670
Buddy, you haven't gotten any taller.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.130
<i>How do you know that? Creepy man.</i>

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.840
Now, my turn.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.170
<i>Your chin.</i>

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.170
Nendou, 75.3 inches.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:03.760
What the hell? The same as last year?

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:06.380
<i>Of course, we're stuck in a time loop.</i>

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.140
<i>As I previously explained,</i>
<i>to stop the volcano from erupting,</i>

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:11.100
<i>I turned back time on the earth</i>

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.600
<i>and people are also restored each year.</i>

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:18.560
<i>So every living thing on earth</i>
<i>doesn't get any older or any taller now.</i>

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.360
Kaidou, 62.55 inches.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:21.440
I shrank?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:24.070
<i>Tiny gaps may exist.</i>

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:25.570
Try it again!

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:26.740
<i>Your chin!</i>

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:29.530
-62.51 inches.
-Someone is trying to frame me!

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.040
<i>So everybody gets similar results</i>
<i>as last year's.</i>

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:34.370
<i>However, nobody gets suspicious about it</i>

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.080
<i>because I control their minds.</i>

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.580
Stop laughing, bastard!

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:42.550
-There's Mr. Pervert.
-So what?

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.170
I just wonder what Mr. Pervert is doing.

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.510
<i>Stop calling him like that.</i>

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:48.470
Yeah, he seems to be in a hurry.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.470
Hey, what do you think about him?

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.140
-He has a funny face.
-Not his face, his personality!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.180
Hey, Nendou-kun and Kaidou-kun,
we're gonna check your sitting height.

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:57.520
<i>Tell me what your chin does.</i>

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:00.770
-What was that?
-It was from the school building.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.070
Looks like there's a Peeping Tom.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:04.530
Is Teruhashi-san alright?

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.530
-Is Teruhashi-san safe?
-What about her?

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:07.490
Our Teruhashi-san!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.780
<i>Worry about other girls, too.</i>

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:11.740
-Has anyone seen anyone suspicious?
-Suspicious?

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:12.990
That's him!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.830
I can't believe this!

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:18.120
Even though he failed,
he tried to see me naked!

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:20.130
I'll never let the peeper
get away with it!

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.380
-Yeah, right.
-Good luck.

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.300
Aren't you guys really mad at him?

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.260
Hey! Where have you been?

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.590
There was a peeper!

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.680
-Really?
-Go get him!

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.510
<i>He was headed in the direction</i>
<i>of the nurse's office.</i>

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.720
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:36.180
<i>That's right.</i>
<i>Keep that thought to yourself.</i>

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.060
<i>It will just make things complicated,</i>
<i>because...</i>

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:42.400
<i>The person standing outside the office</i>
<i>was actually Mr. Iguchi.</i>

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.230
<i>He just passed by the nurse's office.</i>

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:46.860
<i>He wasn't peeping.</i>

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:51.110
<i>He just needed to go to the washroom.</i>
<i>What a troublesome situation.</i>

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:54.160
-You have to catch the peeper!
-<i>But he is lucky in one sense.</i>

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:57.370
<i>What a dirty guy!</i>
<i>That really makes me sick!</i>

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.120
<i>He has no idea that he is the peeper.</i>

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:05.460
<i>If he knew, he'd make excuses,</i>
<i>be labeled as a pervert and sent to jail.</i>

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:08.550
<i>So, it is best to leave it.</i>
<i>Kaidou, don't say anything.</i>

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.630
-I'll do whatever it takes to catch him.
-<i>And you, too.</i>

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:13.350
<i>Is he going to search for the peeper?</i>
<i>So, it wasn't him after all?</i>

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:15.890
-I'm counting on you.
-Leave it to me!

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:17.680
<i>I have to go to the washroom again.</i>

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.520
<i>I feel bad for suspecting him.</i>

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.980
RUMBLING

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:22.690
<i>-He's sweating!</i>
-<i>He just needs to poo.</i>

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:26.730
<i>He seems like he's hiding something</i>
<i>all of a sudden!</i>

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:27.650
<i>That he has to poo.</i>

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.530
-<i>I have to find out what he's hiding.</i>
-<i>All you'll find is poo.</i>

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.610
-<i>He's gotta reveal everything.</i>
-<i>You'll get poo.</i>

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.740
-<i>Hold on.</i>
-Saiki?

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:36.870
<i>-He's saved...</i>
-Yo! Going to the nurse's office again?

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.580
-<i>No, he wasn't!</i>
-<i>What? Again?</i>

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:41.580
-<i>I've never visited the nurse's office.</i>
-Did he go to the nurse's office?

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:44.290
You headed toward the nurse's office
during the physical exams.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.750
<i>I was just heading to the washroom.</i>

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:50.300
-Nendou must have misunderstood.
-Right, Mr. Iguchi wasn't involved.

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:53.510
-<i>Was it the nurse's office?</i>
-He's panicking!

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.970
Mr. Iguchi, you have to explain!

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:57.510
<i>It ended up this way after all.</i>

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.270
<i>Now all I can do to help him out is...</i>
<i>He can do that.</i>

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:02.480
Shoot! They've drawn the curtains.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:07.150
<i>Wait. The curtain is nearly blown up?</i>
<i>It's blown up! Hey! What the hell!</i>

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:09.860
Jeez. I couldn't watch it.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.700
He actually just passed by.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.820
-What? Where am I?
-I'm sorry, Mr. Iguchi!

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:17.370
-I'm so sorry!
-It's okay, guys.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:20.830
<i>Great job, buddy. You saved his life</i>

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:21.910
<i>by...</i>

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.210
I... I'm sorry.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:25.960
<i>...sacrificing yourself.</i>

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:30.960
VISITING A FRIEND'S HOUSE
WHILE THEIR PARENTS ARE OUT

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:33.170
I'm hungry.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.640
-How about going for some noodles?
-It's a plan!

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:38.390
-Ramen noodles?
-Yeah, you can join us if you want.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.220
-No, I'm fine today.
-<i>Are you?</i>

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.680
-Are you sure?
-Yeah, I don't have money.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.440
Why not?
I thought you are working part time.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.810
Someone asked me
to lend them some money this morning.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.520
-Were you scammed?
-Were you robbed?

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:50.570
Not like that.

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.740
<i>There was this brat crying in the street.</i>

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:57.200
<i>He'd found a cat that'd been run over,</i>
<i>but he had no money to take it to a vet.</i>

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:59.330
So I gave him all I had.

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:02.000
My, what a touching episode!

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.040
I'll treat you.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.040
-What's wrong?
-What happened next?

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.670
Did you take the boy to a vet?

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.460
-Why?
-A kid can't go to a vet by himself.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:13.380
A kid? He was a macho guy
with a buzz cut and a flashy shirt.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:14.300
Tell us that first!

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:17.010
-He wasn't a brat, after all!
-It's obvious with that haircut!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:20.260
-I won't treat you, then!
-How about coming to my house?

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:23.270
My parents are out,
so I can make some instant noodles.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.230
-Really?
-Sounds interesting.

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:26.350
<i>No thanks.</i>

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:29.360
<i>Wait, my parents are out, too.</i>

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:33.440
-It's the anniversary of our seventh date.
-So, you eat on your own tonight.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.990
<i>I was going to eat out anyway.</i>

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:36.530
-You're coming, right?
-<i>That's okay.</i>

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:40.580
Here it is. That's my house.
It used to be my grandparents' house.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.290
Because my dad was a gang member,
people hold grudges.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:44.200
<i>His hair...</i>

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:47.420
He's beaten up those
who messed up the walls, though.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.210
Come on in. This is my room.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.500
<i>So punk.</i>

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:55.340
You guys just relax.
I'll go make some ramen noodles.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.050
-But where should we sit?
-Hey, why are you standing there?

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.050
-Come and sit here.
-<i>He is so part of it.</i>

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:03.390
-I can sit here.
-<i>He's also playing a part</i>

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:04.600
<i>as a gofer.</i>

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:07.980
This is so cliché,
like something out of a gang movie.

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.480
Is this your first time, too?

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.610
I've been in the garage but not inside.

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:13.480
This looks like so much fun.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.940
-Hey, don't touch them without asking him.
-Well...

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:20.910
-Not much to see.
-Stop snooping!

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:22.410
<i>I think there is much to see.</i>

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:23.910
How about this drawer?

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.370
You must stop, otherwise...

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.160
What are these...
Hey! Why did you shut the drawer?

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:30.790
-Shut up! Stop snooping!
-<i>Nice move, Kaidou.</i>

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.750
<i>We didn't see anything.</i>

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.460
Is this his photo album?

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:35.920
I said not to snoop...

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:38.590
He is tiny!

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.260
Even Aren was once a baby.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.510
It should be safe to look at, I believe.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.220
-Don't worry. It won't hurt you.
-Right.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:46.220
<i>What kind of theory?</i>

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:48.810
Let's see at what age he began to fall.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:50.270
Yeah. Isn't it too young?

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.520
He started to fall at two months old!

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:53.610
HE WANTS TO PEEK

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.110
It's not his fault.
It's because of his parents.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.320
-He looks normal at one year old.
-True.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.530
-He is two.
-So, it's only in that one photo.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:02.490
-Three years old.
-His hair is getting long.

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:05.950
-At the entrance ceremony in preschool.
-Since preschool?

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:09.410
-He's been punk since then.
-I didn't expect that.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.750
-What are you doing?
-Aren! This is not...

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.210
Ramen is ready.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.460
Where did you find the album?

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:19.630
-Sorry we looked at it without asking you.
-It's fine.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:22.510
But don't you ever touch
the second drawer, no matter what.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:24.850
-That--
-I didn't even know there's a drawer!

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:27.930
This brings back memories.
I was so full of myself back then.

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.640
-You went astray so early.
-It must be his parents' doing.

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.980
Both of my parents were gang members,
so we had lots of problems.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.900
-He was such a scary parent.
-Were you all right?

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:39.280
He was so harsh
but didn't do anything wrong.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:41.030
He was a gang leader,

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.990
but he straightened himself out
after I was born.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:48.830
<i>He quit having a ducktail and long hair</i>
<i>so he could start working seriously.</i>

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.250
<i>He takes life seriously.</i>

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.210
<i>I'd never tell him so, but I respect him.</i>

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:54.920
I see. He's not here today, is he?

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.540
Don't be afraid.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:58.000
He's been softer for a while now.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:01.510
He was in a gang, but he is totally
different from that bastard Nendou met.

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:04.510
-<i>I'm home.</i>
-There he is.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:06.970
-You're home early today.
-Aren, you have guests?

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:08.560
Let me introduce them.

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:10.310
Nice to meet you!

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:11.390
REAN KUBOYASU
AGE 36

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:13.850
-Yo! Good to meet you!
-<i>He is totally active in his career.</i>

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.690
Hey, I met you this morning.

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:18.650
That's you!
Thanks for your help this morning.

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.740
Was it you who borrowed money from him?

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.860
No problem at all. Was the cat okay?

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:25.450
Yeah, she is fine!
Let me give you the money back.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:27.030
You have a good buddy, Aren!

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.370
Yeah, right...

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.950
<i>They couldn't help</i>
<i>but have mixed feelings.</i>

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:35.920
LET'S AIM FOR A DEBUT IN <i>JUMP MAGAZINE!</i>

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:36.830
KAIDOU'S HOUSE

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:40.630
My brother is going to have
a secret meeting with his subordinates.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:45.430
So I will go patrol around town
so the Dark Reunion won't bother him.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:48.350
-Hey, this is not right.
-Look at this book.

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.140
-I get it now.
-That's right.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:52.600
-Finished!
-That's perfect!

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:54.560
<i>-Arlong from One Piece.</i>
<i>-Do your homework.</i>

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:55.980
<i>Or I'll leave.</i>

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.610
<i>I'm pretending that I haven't finished yet</i>
<i>so you can't copy it,</i>

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.230
<i>but I've already finished my homework.</i>

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.400
You're really good at drawing.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.610
You can be a manga artist.

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.160
It's not that easy!

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:08.570
Even if I can draw, I can't write a story.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:09.910
What?

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:11.700
I can write a story.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.410
<i>Okay, they will never do homework.</i>

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.460
Let's become manga artists together, Aren!

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.250
Because I'm not really a good artist.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:18.380
<i>Not really?</i>

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:20.460
Hey, what are you planning
without my consent?

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:22.090
Can you really write a story?

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:23.670
Yeah, I'm doing it in my own way, though.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:25.680
This is my most recent work.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:27.470
The title is <i>Black Dragon Night.</i>

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:28.640
<i>It already sounds bad.</i>

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.100
It consists of 13 notebooks,

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:32.970
so it will be about 42 volumes
in manga format.

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:34.310
<i>It's as big as </i>Dragon Ball.

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:37.020
The story is based
on my autobiography, though.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:39.150
<i>Then there shouldn't be that many volumes.</i>

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:41.360
All right, let me see if it's good.

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:44.490
<i>This is Planet Avante where genocides</i>
<i>and destruction occur everywhere.</i>

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:45.820
<i>It's not autobiography.</i>

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:52.370
<i>Avante was once a peaceful place where</i>
<i>18 people called, "Illusional Wise Men..."</i>

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:57.000
<i>...people lived with fear</i>
<i>inside the barriered wall called Life.</i>

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.790
<i>...as told of in the prophecy by the wise</i>
<i>old man Rohm,</i>

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:01.210
<i>the effect of Life will be lost...</i>

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.500
<i>However, Eria was attacked by Skelton Men.</i>

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:06.510
<i>She was saved by a mysterious boy, Kaito.</i>

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:07.720
How was it?

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.800
-Let's do homework!
-What's wrong?

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:11.550
We're here to do homework, right?

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:13.770
Don't you have anything to say?
What about you, Saiki?

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:16.810
Hey, look at me! How about you, Nendou?

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.520
I remember that Planet A-something
was in danger.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.690
Don't give up after the first line!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:26.610
I'm shocked I get only negative feedback
for a plot I spent three years on.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:28.400
<i>I'm shocked you spent that long on it.</i>

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:30.160
No, hold on!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:31.780
This story is not over yet.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.370
There is a surprise ending coming up!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:35.540
Like what?

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:36.830
Well, I can't tell you now.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:40.290
<i>They will be shocked</i>
<i>if they find out Kaito is a Skelton Man.</i>

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:44.250
What if Kaito is a Skelton Man?
Too cheesy?

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:47.760
Of course. That's so boring. I already
crossed that off the list of endings.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:49.130
Hey, what will the ending be like?

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:50.970
-Let's do homework.
-What's wrong?

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:55.430
I know! Kaito is not a Skelton Man
but the other opponent, Eden!

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:58.180
That's it! How did you know that?

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:00.650
Shun, I think the story is not bad.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:03.480
<i>It'd be less impressive</i>
<i>if the main character was a Skelton Man,</i>

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:05.110
<i>but if he was an Eden, that'd be dramatic.</i>

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:06.230
Yeah.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:09.030
I know! He belongs to a group
that was separated from the main Eden,

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:12.410
and Skelton Men will come after him
to reunite Eden!

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:13.870
-Then what?
-<i>He's getting into it.</i>

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:18.450
<i>It's the perfect Eden. The main character</i>
<i>and heroine will start to realize it.</i>

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:21.250
<i>If only I wasn't here!</i>
<i>The people and the planet I love!</i>

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:25.420
It's a love story that breaks
racial barriers! This is great, Shun!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.920
-Yeah...
-Can I draw a picture of Kaito?

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.880
Yeah, please!
Character designs are important.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:31.880
How's that?

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.340
<i>Why the ducktail?</i>

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:34.850
Isn't he cool?

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:39.520
But Kaito isn't the type of person
who has hair like this...

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.940
It's a fantasy, so just assume
his hair is naturally that way.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.560
<i>I wouldn't like a main character</i>
<i>such as this.</i>

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.570
-I can change that if you like.
-Really?

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:48.480
-Let's start working on it anyway.
-Yeah, we have no time for homework.

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:50.990
-We'll be manga artists!
-Your dad is an editor.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:51.900
<i>It's your delusion.</i>

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:54.070
-Let's ask him to read it.
<i>-Jump...</i>

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.120
What? <i>Jump?</i>

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.950
Yeah. Okay.

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:01.580
-Sorry, Saiki. Just in case, you know?
-<i>Dad's magazine is their last choice.</i>

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:05.420
<i>Well, they will face reality</i>
<i>very soon anyway.</i>

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.380
-Shut your mouths, you idiots!
-<i>Kaidou's sister.</i>

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.840
Sora!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.260
Don't you guys need to study?

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:14.720
Sorry. We'll keep quiet.

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:17.310
-What's this?
-That's...

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:21.520
-They want to succeed as manga artists.
-Don't tell!

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:25.230
You guys are really hopeless.
You're just trying to escape from reality.

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.230
And the story is not interesting at all.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:32.990
How will you be able to create manga
when you can't even finish homework?

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:35.160
Okay, let's do homework.

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:41.000
PLEASE VISIT THERE AND ENJOY

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.080
MIDNIGHT SWEETS

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:44.870
<i>This program is intended</i>
<i>for sweets lovers.</i>

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.830
<i>Your sweet moments, </i>Midnight Sweets.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.340
<i>It's started.</i>

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.460
<i>It's a TV program</i>
<i>that introduces delicious sweets.</i>

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:54.760
<i>I always look forward to it enough to wait</i>
<i>like this for 30 minutes before it starts.</i>

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:58.800
<i>There has been a flood of complaints</i>
<i>about airing a sweets show at midnight,</i>

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:01.470
<i>but I have a fast metabolism,</i>
<i>so I have no issue with it.</i>

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:03.100
<i>I wonder what tonight's sweets are.</i>

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.900
<i>Our guest for tonight</i>
<i>is an actor, Tooru Mugami.</i>

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:06.810
<i>Good evening.</i>

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:12.780
<i>Your face just ruined my sweet time.</i>

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.570
<i>Do you like sweets, Mr. Mugami?</i>

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.660
To be honest,
I don't like sweets very much.

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:20.620
<i>Why did you accept the offer? Well,</i>
<i>these siblings never stop bothering me.</i>

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:23.000
<i>-I don't like them.</i>
<i>-Teruhashi's brother!</i>

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.710
But my sister loves sweets.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.080
<i>It's a well-known fact</i>
<i>that you love your sister.</i>

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:29.540
<i>Yes, so I want to tell her</i>
<i>about delicious sweets.</i>

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:31.670
<i>Watch out! His feelings for her</i>
<i>go way beyond fraternal love.</i>

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.340
What do you like about her the most?

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.630
This is hard.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:37.340
Bro...

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:39.600
First, she is the prettiest girl
in the universe,

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:42.430
also her hair, the shapes of her ears,
and her voice are the best.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:46.190
And her smell, clear skin,
hands, fingers and fingerprints...

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:48.100
I mentioned too much about her appearance.

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:50.480
Of course, I love her personality
and everything.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.610
For example, she is nice to everybody.

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:55.740
And she cares about family. She's smart,
polite and considerate of others,

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.860
-but she sometimes wants to be cared for.
-<i>Too long.</i>

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:01.580
-I think that's enough--
-<i>What kind of show is this?</i>

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:02.790
<i>"Midnight Teruhashi"?</i>

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:05.540
Excuse me,
this is a show about sweets, so...

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:07.500
Are you saying
that my sister is not a sweet?

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:08.500
She's not, is she?

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:12.130
<i>But she gives me smiles</i>
<i>a lot sweeter than any sweets.</i>

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:14.170
<i>-Does she?</i>
<i>-Well, this is no good.</i>

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.470
<i>I don't feel like watching this anymore.</i>
<i>I am going to bed.</i>

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:20.800
<i>Okay, let's make a fresh start now.</i>
<i>Our sweet tonight is coffee jelly.</i>

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:21.800
<i>What?</i>

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:24.850
<i>-Here is the café we are visiting today.</i>
<i>-I can't believe it!</i>

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:26.730
<i>I have no choice but to watch it.</i>

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:29.190
<i>This is their signature dish,</i>
<i>coffee jelly.</i>

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:32.690
<i>They take 300 orders or more</i>
<i>on a busy day.</i>

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.280
<i>Which café is this?</i>

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:37.320
<i>Look at this delicacy</i>
<i>and its beautiful shape.</i>

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.740
<i>The spoon goes in</i>
<i>like it's being sucked into it.</i>

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:42.280
<i>It shines bright like gems.</i>

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:45.200
How does that taste, Mugami-kun?

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.660
<i>Why are you there?</i>

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.290
<i>Mugami-kun is visiting with us</i>
<i>to give some comments.</i>

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:50.290
<i>I wish he didn't.</i>

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:52.290
Mugami-kun, how is it?

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:53.540
-Me?
-<i>You, of course!</i>

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:54.750
-It's yummy.
-<i>So short!</i>

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:57.590
<i>Can't you talk about anything</i>
<i>other than your sister?</i>

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:00.510
That was a surprise.
You visited there for us.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:01.800
Yes, I did.

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:03.720
<i>He didn't give</i>
<i>any decent comments, though.</i>

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.260
<i>Which café was it after all?</i>

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:09.770
Here, we've got the coffee jellies,
the same ones as he tried at the cafe.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:11.480
-<i>Looking good.</i>
-Let's eat.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:13.690
-I already tried it, so I'm okay.
-<i>It's not okay!</i>

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:17.030
<i>-I know that you tried it already, but--</i>
<i>-Then, can I have it to go?</i>

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:18.150
<i>Just do your job, will you?</i>

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.740
<i>Just edit his scenes out.</i>

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.280
How's that, Mugami-kun?

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.160
It's yummy, just like before.

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:26.660
Since I put it in my mouth, my mouth
has been filled with the rich coffee aroma

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:29.660
and I feel the beautiful harmony
of its richness and savory flavor.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:31.580
-It's so yummy.
-<i>He's just reading lines.</i>

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.630
<i>-And the comments are so lame.</i>
<i>-Thank you.</i>

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.420
<i>-Here is the café's information.</i>
<i>-Yes!</i>

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.550
-This is so good.
-The café's name is...

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:41.260
-I had no idea that it would be so good.
-And it's located at...

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:43.390
-I should get some for her.
-Their business hours...

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.600
<i>Hey, shut him up.</i>

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:48.770
<i>And for this show's viewers only, </i>

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:51.980
<i>you can try the coffee jelly</i>
<i>at half price!</i>

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:53.150
<i>I gotta go!</i>

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:56.610
<i>Tell them, "I love Mugami-kun"</i>
<i>at the check out.</i>

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:57.530
<i>No way.</i>

00:19:57.610 --> 00:20:00.110
<i>He has one final announcement.</i>

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:01.740
<i>Yes, it's my movie...</i>

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:04.490
<i>My sweet time was completely ruined.</i>

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.120
-Kokomi...
-<i>Creepy.</i>

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.200
<i>What are you doing?</i>
<i>Don't come in without asking.</i>

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:11.960
I had a lover's spat with Kokomi again.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.790
She said, "Don't talk about me on TV!"

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:17.750
What will you do if I get chosen
as the heroine of morning drama series?

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:20.010
I don't want to share Kokomi
with other people.

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:22.970
Okay, I'll talk about you not as my
sister but as my girlfriend next time.

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:24.470
That's enough!

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.430
<i>I don't think your agency would allow it.</i>

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:28.100
<i>Anyway, just leave now. Seriously,</i>

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:30.390
-<i>I didn't want to see your face.</i>
-What should I do with these?

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:32.890
I've have all these coffee jellies
for Kokomi,

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:35.980
but she said she didn't want them
and pushed them back at me.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:37.690
What should I do?

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:40.940
-<i>I love Mugami-kun.</i>
-Will you help me out?

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.030
Subtitle translation by Kanako Murakoshi
